            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 10:16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.15+2CH.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 9:15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kale kyabazinga Shishaki ow'e Misiri yaidha yaalumba Yerusalemu. Yaanhaga eby'obukombe eby'omu isinzizo n'eby'omu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, byonabyona yaabitwala. Yaatwala n'engabo dhoonadhoona edha zaabu, Solomoni dhe yagheesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Rehoboamu yaagheesa engabo mu kyuma ky'ekikomo okwira mu kifo ky'edho, yaadhigemya abakulu ab'abakuumi abaakuumanga omulyango gw'ekisaagaati kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga buli lwe yaingiranga mu isinzizo, ng'abakuumi batwala engabo edho, ate baamalanga baadhiizaayo mu ndhu mwe baadhikuumiranga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olw'okuba Rehoboamu yagonda, Musengwa Katonda kyeyava n'atamusungughalira kumuzikiriza, n'ensi Buyudaaya yaasigala ng'ebintu bikaagijiira bukalamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Rehoboamu yaakakata ku bwakyabazinga mu Yerusalemu. Ghe yainhamira okufuga yali agheza emyaka egy'obukulu amakumi ana na mulala (41), era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myaka ikumi na musanvu (17) mu Yerusalemu, ekibuga Musengwa Katonda kye yalondagho mu Isiraeli yoonayoona okumusinzizangamu. Inhina wa Rehoboamu yali ng'ayetebwa Naama, era nga Muammoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu oyo yaakola ebibi, yaaloba kufaayo kujiiranga ku ebyo Musengwa Katonda by'ayenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Rehoboamu bye yakola, okuva lwe yatoolera okufuga okutuuka ku nkomerero, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo eky'Ebyomubyanda eby'omulanzi Shemaia n'omulanzi Iddo. Ekiseera ekyo kyonakyona, ghaabangagho entalo edhomwidhirano ghagati gha Rehoboamu ni Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Rehoboamu oyo yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, yaaziikibwa mu lwambiidhi lwa badhaadha be abo, mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi. Mutabane we eyayetebwanga Abiya, n'eyasikira ise oyo ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
